LLMModel.getResponseJson","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/getResponseJson.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Returns the buffered assistant message as a decoded JSON object.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"getTokenCount","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.getTokenCount","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/getTokenCount.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Returns the number of tokens in text using the opened model's tokenizer.\nCall after open; throws if the model is unopened.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"open","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.open","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/open.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Opens a GGUF model or a self-contained, SoC-specific QNN text package.\nWith no backend argument, GGUF uses automatic GPU fitting with CPU\nfallback, while .qnn selects HTP (QNN). Explicit Metal/GPU selection\nstill fits layers to available memory, but requires some GPU offload.\nCPU/GPU for .qnn or HTP for GGUF is rejected.\nUse openMultimodalProjectorFile afterwards for vision or audio.\nmodelPath is the model file path; nCtx is the context size in tokens.\nA context size of zero selects the package/model default.\nbackend accepts a name from getBackendList or a backend constant;\na constant selects the first matching device, and an empty string selects\nautomatically. Any existing instance is closed before opening the model.\nThrows if the backend is unavailable or native initialization fails.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"openMtpModel","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.openMtpModel","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/openMtpModel.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Open an MTP assistant and enable draft/target verification decoding.\nUse a matching Gemma 4 assistant GGUF, or assistant .qnn for a QNN target.\nCall once after open and before setting a prompt.\nSupports text generation with CPU/GPU Gemma 4 GGUF and QNN models.\nassistantPath is the assistant model file path.\nnDraft is required: must be at least 1; QNN supports up to 3 draft tokens.\nThrows an ArgumentError if nDraft is not a positive unsigned 32-bit\ninteger, or an Exception if the target is unopened or loading fails.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"openMultimodalProjectorFile","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.openMultimodalProjectorFile","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/openMultimodalProjectorFile.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Opens a matching vision/audio projector after open. Accepts a GGUF\nprojector or a self-contained, SoC-specific QNN projector package.\nmmprojPath is the projector file path. Load it before submitting media\nwith setPrompt or setPromptJson.\nThrows if the model is unopened or projector loading fails.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"pLLm","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.pLLm","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/pLLm.html","kind":16,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"setNumThreads","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.setNumThreads","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/setNumThreads.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Sets the CPU thread count before open.\nnThreads is 0 for automatic selection, which is also the default.\nOn Android, automatic selection uses performance (big/prime) cores,\nfalling back to the existing core-count heuristic if topology is unavailable.\nTarget decode/prefill, assistant and VLM/ALM CPU inference threads share this value.\nThrows an ArgumentError for values outside 0..INT_MAX, or an Exception\nif the model is already open or the native operation fails.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"setPrompt","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.setPrompt","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/setPrompt.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Sets the complete conversation history for text or multimodal generation.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"setPromptJson","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.setPromptJson","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/setPromptJson.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Sets structured JSON history, required with tools. User content arrays\nsupport text and image or audio with file_path or base64 data. Load a\nmatching projector first; submit image and audio in separate prompts.\nmessages is the complete conversation history, including assistant tool\ncalls and tool results with matching tool_call_id values when applicable.\nResets streaming text on success. Throws if the model is unopened, JSON\nencoding fails, or the native operation fails (including context overflow).\nUse contextFull to inspect whether the prompt exceeded the context.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"setSamplingParams","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.setSamplingParams","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/setSamplingParams.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Sets token sampling parameters after open and before setting a prompt.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"setThinking","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.setThinking","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/setThinking.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Enable or disable thinking (reasoning output).\nControls whether thinking models (e.g. Gemma4) output their reasoning process.\nenable selects whether reasoning output is enabled.\nCall after open and before setPrompt or setPromptJson.\nThrows if the model is unopened or the native operation fails.","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"setTools","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.AiliaLLMModel.setTools","href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel/setTools.html","kind":10,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Set the tool (function) definitions for tool use (function calling).","enclosedBy":{"name":"AiliaLLMModel","kind":3,"href":"ailia_llm_model/AiliaLLMModel-class.html"}},{"name":"BACKEND_CPU","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.BACKEND_CPU","href":"ailia_llm_model/BACKEND_CPU-constant.html","kind":19,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Selects the CPU backend.","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}},{"name":"BACKEND_HTP","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.BACKEND_HTP","href":"ailia_llm_model/BACKEND_HTP-constant.html","kind":19,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Selects the Qualcomm Hexagon HTP backend provided by QNN.","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}},{"name":"BACKEND_METAL","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.BACKEND_METAL","href":"ailia_llm_model/BACKEND_METAL-constant.html","kind":19,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Selects the first available Metal backend.","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}},{"name":"BACKEND_OPENCL","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.BACKEND_OPENCL","href":"ailia_llm_model/BACKEND_OPENCL-constant.html","kind":19,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Selects the first available OpenCL backend.","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}},{"name":"BACKEND_VULKAN","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.BACKEND_VULKAN","href":"ailia_llm_model/BACKEND_VULKAN-constant.html","kind":19,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Selects the first available Vulkan backend.","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}},{"name":"VkEnumerateInstanceVersionDart","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.VkEnumerateInstanceVersionDart","href":"ailia_llm_model/VkEnumerateInstanceVersionDart.html","kind":21,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}},{"name":"VkEnumerateInstanceVersionNative","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.VkEnumerateInstanceVersionNative","href":"ailia_llm_model/VkEnumerateInstanceVersionNative.html","kind":21,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}},{"name":"disambiguateBackendNames","qualifiedName":"ailia_llm_model.disambiguateBackendNames","href":"ailia_llm_model/disambiguateBackendNames.html","kind":8,"overriddenDepth":0,"packageRank":0,"desc":"Returns unique display names for the backends in names.","enclosedBy":{"name":"ailia_llm_model","kind":9,"href":"ailia_llm_model/ailia_llm_model-library.html"}}]
